  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"x-section e4254-e1 m3a6-0 m3a6-1 clip-title\"><div class=\"x-container e4254-e2 m3a6-6\"><div class=\"x-column x-sm x-1-1 e4254-e3 m3a6-7\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e4254-e4 m3a6-8 m3a6-9\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h1 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Manifest Nirvana<br/>Online Teaching 7th March 2020</h1></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e4254-e5 m3a6-0 m3a6-2 m3a6-3\"><div class=\"x-container e4254-e6 m3a6-6\"><div class=\"x-column x-sm x-1-1 e4254-e7 m3a6-7\"><blockquote class=\"x-quote e4254-e8 m3a6-b\"><div class=\"x-quote-content\"><div class=\"x-quote-text\"><p><em>In Manifest Nirvana we experience the consciousness of eternity.</em><br/>\n<em> Giving rise to Manifest Nirvana is the goal of Evolutionary Enlightenment.</em><br/>\n<em> Manifest Nirvana is a living, ever evolving intersubjective world space that we create together.</em></p><p>– Andrew Cohen</p></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e4254-e9 m3a6-0 m3a6-4\" id=\"five-obstacles-clip\"><div class=\"x-container e4254-e10 m3a6-6\"><div class=\"x-column x-sm x-1-1 e4254-e11 m3a6-7\"><hr class=\"x-line e4254-e12 m3a6-c\"/><div class=\"x-frame x-frame-video-embed e4254-e13 m3a6-d m3a6-e\"><div class=\"x-frame-inner\"><div class=\"x-video x-video-embed\"><div><iframe allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"about:blank\"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"x-section e4254-e14 m3a6-0 m3a6-2 m3a6-5\"><div class=\"x-row e4254-e15 m3a6-f m3a6-g\"><div class=\"x-row-inner\"><div class=\"x-col e4254-e16 m3a6-h\"><div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e4254-e17 m3a6-8 m3a6-a\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Help build Manifest Nirvana!</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"x-text x-content e4254-e18 m3a6-i\"><p>Find out more about about our inspiring new projec